# DIAGNOSTICS

`no input files`; `unknown option <arg>`; `can't read <path>`; `no @IPCLibrary libraries in <files>`; `<id> has no baseline at <path>; run with --update-baseline to record one`; `<path> is not a baseline`.
Errors from reading the declarations, such as two methods whose ordinals collide, or composed methods whose names or ordinals collide, are printed and stop it.
